<Layout title="Valora — Fractional Family Office Architecture" pageLabel="Fractional Family Office Architecture" active="about">
  <h1 class="headline">We help families build offices that work for them.</h1>
  <div class="body-block">
    <p class="body">Family offices that begin with strategic foundations - values, identity, how decisions are made - are built to last. Structure, governance and investment policy all perform differently when they emerge from a clear sense of who the family is.</p>
    <p class="body">We work with families at every stage - building from scratch, refining what exists or navigating transition - always at your cadence, not ours.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="rhythm">Foundation first. Operations second. Evolution always.</p>
</Layout>
